        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-neutral-200"><div class="text-2xl font-black text-neutral-300 mb-2">2</div><p class="font-semibold text-neutral-800 mb-1">Audit technique</p><p class="text-xs">Security headers, Schema.org, Open Graph, SEO, stack technique (WordPress + Elementor + GTM + GA + Meta Pixel).</p></div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-neutral-200"><div class="text-2xl font-black text-neutral-300 mb-2">3</div><p class="font-semibold text-neutral-800 mb-1">10 personas simulees</p><p class="text-xs">Profils realistes de clientes Nancy/Metz — soins visage, corps, epilation, cheveux, blanchiment dentaire.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA FINAL -->
  <section class="py-16 border-t border-neutral-200">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
